## The Score

@narrator: Tallying the score.

<match on="run.score">
  <when is="..0">
    @hero: Nothing yet.
  </when>
  <when is="1..3">
    @hero: A modest haul.
  </when>
  <when is="4..">
    @hero: A fortune.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @hero: Somewhere in between.
  </otherwise>
</match>
